kind: llman.sdd.spec
name: "agent-runtime"
purpose: "TBD - created by archiving change c25-add-agent-loop. Update purpose after archive."
valid_scope[2]: src/,tests/
requirements[36]{req_id,title,statement}:
  r1,"execution-loop","System MUST implement a self-contained ReAct loop (XyRunner) that calls XyModel for generation and dispatches XyTool calls until completion or max_iterations."
  r2,"event-system","System MUST emit AgentEvent variants (TextDelta / ThinkingDelta / ToolCallStart / ToolCallEnd / StepComplete / Error) from XyRunner without any adk-core Event dependency."
  r3,"session-runtime",System MUST manage session history via XySession trait with InMemorySession as default backend.
  r4,"openai-provider","System MUST support OpenAI chat completions and streaming via async-openai with tool calling and base_url override."
  r5,"anthropic-provider",System MUST support Anthropic messages API and streaming via reqwest with tool_use and base_url override.
  r6,"content-types","System MUST define XyContent and XyPart types (Text / Thinking / FunctionCall / FunctionResponse) independent of adk-core."
  ar1,"thin-agent-loop","The agent/ layer MUST contain only the ReAct loop (runtime/react.rs), hook cut-points (runtime/hooks.rs), event types (runtime/event.rs), and orchestration state (current model/tool selection); it MUST NOT inline prompt formatting, bash execution logic, or output guarding logic in the loop file."
  ar2,统一事件输出,Agent runtime MUST emit XyEvent variants from the ReAct loop; the legacy AgentEvent enum MUST be removed.
  ar3,"tool-execution","Agent runtime MUST execute all tool calls from a single model response before the next model call, supporting both sequential and parallel execution modes."
  ar4,"ports-via-builder","Agent construction MUST go through an AgentBuilder that takes the minimal required ports (ModelRegistry, model builder, Arc<dyn XySessionStore>, Arc<dyn XyEventSink>, Arc<dyn XyPermission>) in its constructor and adds every other capability via consuming builder methods with defaults; the Agent::new(session) and Agent::with_ports(...) positional constructors MUST be removed."
  ar5,统一事件流类型,Agent runtime MUST expose the loop as an async Stream<XyEvent> for consumer layers via XyEventStream.
  ar8,"session-cwd","Agent runtime MUST validate session working directory exists on session creation and import, returning an error with the missing path when CWD is not accessible."
  ar9,"infra-diagnostics","Agent runtime MUST collect non-fatal diagnostics (info/warning/error) during session creation covering: missing API keys, unknown model references, extension load failures, and CWD issues."
  ar10,defaults,"System MUST centralize default values: DEFAULT_THINKING_LEVEL = medium, DEFAULT_MODEL for each known provider, DEFAULT_MAX_ITERATIONS = 50, DEFAULT_COMPACTION_THRESHOLD = 0.8."
  ar11,"bdd-runtime-v3","BDD tests for session-cwd validation and defaults MUST all pass."
  ar12,"output-guard-takeover","Agent runtime MUST support stdout takeover that redirects all process.stdout.write calls to stderr, enabling clean output in print mode. The takeover state must be queryable via is_stdout_taken_over()."
  ar13,"output-guard-restore","Agent runtime MUST support stdout restore returning process.stdout.write to its original implementation, and write_raw_stdout that bypasses the takeover for direct output."
  ar14,"bdd-runtime-v4",BDD tests for OutputGuard stdout takeover and restore MUST all pass.
  ar15,"no-rloop-keyword","No source file under src/ MUST use the r#loop raw identifier; the ReAct loop module MUST be named runtime::react."
  ar16,"agent-entry-direct","System MUST define ReActAgent (the ReAct-strategy driver) and Agent (the pluggable capability aggregate) directly under agent/ and re-export them from agent/mod.rs; app layers MUST import agent symbols from agent/mod (not from an agent::facade hub); the previous single facade re-export module MUST be removed."
  ar17,"sessionstore-port","System MUST define runtime_protocol::SessionStore with load_context (returns SessionContext), append, and exists methods — the minimal surface the ReAct loop and compaction call; SessionManager MUST implement it."
  ar18,"eventsink-port","System MUST define runtime_protocol::EventSink with emit_lifecycle; EventBus MUST implement it."
  ar19,"lifecyclehandler-in-runtime-protocol","The LifecycleHandler type alias for async event subscriptions MUST reside in runtime_protocol::event, not in domain::lifecycle, because it is a contract detail of the event runtime protocol rather than domain vocabulary."
  ar20,事件映射自动化,"System MUST provide From<&XyEvent> for protocol::Event and TryFrom<&protocol::Event> for XyEvent to replace hand-written proto_to_agent conversions."
  ar21,"agent-builder","System MUST provide an AgentBuilder in agent/ that depends only on runtime_protocol port trait objects and plain data (no concrete infra types, HC-1), defaults tools to an empty ToolSet and bash_executor and export_io to None so a conversation-only agent carries no file or bash or export capability, provides consuming methods tools, system_prompt, hooks, bash, export_io, sandbox, context_files, compaction, max_iterations, and a build method returning Result<Agent, String>."
  ar22,"runtime-mutable-slots","Agent MUST expose turn-level setters set_tools, set_hooks, add_hook, set_sandbox, and set_system_prompt that mutate session-backed capability state and take effect on the NEXT run call; an in-flight turn MUST be unaffected because run snapshots tools, prompt, cancel, and hooks at turn start, so the app or tui layer MAY switch configuration between turns (plan or edit mode) without locks."
  ar23,"hooks-invoked","The ReAct loop MUST consult AgentHooks at the tool-call boundary: before executing a tool it MUST run the before chain where any hook MAY deny the call with a reason that short-circuits to a tool-error result, and after a tool returns it MUST run the after chain where hooks MAY observe or transform the result; when no hooks are registered the loop MUST incur zero overhead. The previous self.hooks field was never read; this requirement wires it."
  ar24,"hook-chains-not-slots","AgentHooks MUST hold before, after, and transform_context as Vec of callbacks appendable at runtime via add_hook, not single Option slots; the steering and follow-up message callbacks MUST be separated into a distinct struct because they are message-injection, not tool-execution interception."
  ar25,"react-agent-naming","AgentLoop MUST be renamed ReActAgent to express it is the ReAct-strategy driver of the Agent capability aggregate; the hollow Agent shell (a single loop_ field with pure delegation methods and zero behavioral increment) MUST be removed and its methods merged into ReActAgent so there is exactly one type that drives a ReAct turn."
  ar26,"facade-layer-removed","The agent::facade intermediate module MUST be removed; ReActAgent and Agent MUST be defined directly under agent/ (for example agent/core.rs or agent/mod.rs) with the builder/hooks/event re-export surface moved to agent/mod.rs; reaching into agent::runtime or agent::session internals from app/ remains a layering violation, but the single public hub MUST be agent/mod, not agent::facade."
  ar27,"react-loop-continues-after-tool-call","The ReAct loop MUST continue to a next model round after executing tool calls (feeding the tool results back into history), and MUST terminate a turn only when a model round produces NO tool call (tool_calls is empty). The loop MUST NOT terminate merely because the model stream emitted XyChunk::Done: providers send Done at the end of every single model stream including ones that contain FunctionCalls (openai yields FunctionCall then Done at finish_reason; anthropic and openai-responses likewise), so treating Done as turn-end aborts every tool-calling turn after one round and the model never sees the tool results. Evidence: react.rs had if done { break } after TurnEnd where done was set by XyChunk::Done, so a tool call (FunctionCall followed by Done) broke the for-loop before the continuation round; a stateful mock model test confirmed the continuation text never reached the caller; the correct termination tool_calls.is_empty() already existed at react.rs:356."
  "ar-q1","pending-message-queue","Agent runtime MUST 提供 PendingMessageQueue（或等价类型），支持 enqueue、drain、clear、has_items，以及 all 与 one-at-a-time 两种 drain 模式；steer 与 follow-up MUST 使用各自独立队列。"
  "ar-q2","react-drains-steering","ReAct 循环 MUST 在每一轮模型调用之前 drain steering 队列并将消息注入历史；MUST 在即将结束（无 tool_calls 且将停止）之前 drain follow-up 队列；若 follow-up 非空 MUST 继续循环而非立即 AgentEnd。"
  "ar-q3","queue-update-events","入队、drain 与 clear 之后，runtime MUST 发射 XyEvent::QueueUpdate，携带当前 steer_count 与 follow_up_count。"
  "ar-q4","abort-clears-steer-keeps-followup","调用 abort 时 runtime MUST 清空 steering 队列且 MUST NOT 清空 follow-up 队列；显式 clear_queue API MUST 允许分别或同时清空两侧队列。"
  "ar-ev1",未知事件可降级,若未来扩展 XyEvent（含可选 Extension/Custom 载荷），应用面与 bridge MUST 对未识别变体降级处理（如 tracing），MUST NOT panic；核心循环 MUST 不依赖厂商专属变体才能完成一轮工具调用。
scenarios[41]{req_id,id,given,when,then}:
  r1,"react-loop",a mock XyModel returns text then tool call then final text,XyRunner executes,all events are emitted and loop terminates after tool response
  r1,"max-iterations",XyModel always returns tool calls,XyRunner reaches max_iterations,loop terminates with MaxIterationsReached error
  r2,"no-adk-events",agent is executing,events are emitted,"no adk_core::Event or adk_runner types appear in the event stream"
  r3,"session-history",a session has 3 turns of history,agent sends a new prompt,all previous turns are included in the XyModel request
  r4,"openai-streaming","an OpenAI-compatible endpoint is configured",agent sends a prompt,"streaming text and tool_call chunks are emitted as adk_core::LlmResponse"
  r5,"anthropic-streaming",an Anthropic endpoint is configured,agent sends a prompt,"streaming content_block_delta events are mapped to adk_core::LlmResponse"
  r6,"part-roundtrip","an XyPart::FunctionCall is created",it is serialized and deserialized,all fields (name / args / id) are preserved
  ar1,"loop-file-thin",runtime/react.rs is inspected,it is read,it contains only the ReAct algorithm and delegates formatting and execution
  ar2,"no-agent-event",the codebase is searched for AgentEvent enum,"rg \"enum AgentEvent\"",zero matches remain
  ar3,"parallel-tools",model returns 3 tool calls with parallel execution mode,tools execute concurrently,all results are appended before next model call
  ar4,"builder-replaces-ctors","Agent::new and Agent::with_ports existed",the change is applied,only AgentBuilder constructs an Agent and the old positional constructors are gone
  ar5,"stream-xy-event",a consumer polls the agent runtime stream,the loop emits events,each item is XyEvent
  ar8,"cwd-exists",a session has cwd /home/user/project and directory exists,session is loaded,no error returned
  ar8,"cwd-missing",a session has cwd /nonexistent/path,session is loaded,error message includes the missing path
  ar9,"diag-missing-key",no API key configured for openai,session is created,diagnostics list contains warning about missing openai API key
  ar10,"default-thinking",no thinking level explicitly set,thinking_level is queried,returns medium
  ar11,"bdd-pass",BDD runner invoked,"cargo test --test bdd","all runtime-v3 scenarios pass"
  ar12,"takeover-redirects",stdout is not taken over,take_over_stdout is called,is_stdout_taken_over returns true
  ar12,"double-takeover-noop",stdout is already taken over,take_over_stdout is called again,no error and is_stdout_taken_over still true
  ar13,restore,stdout is taken over,restore_stdout is called,is_stdout_taken_over returns false and original stdout is restored
  ar14,"bdd-pass",BDD runner invoked,"cargo test --test bdd","all runtime-v4 scenarios pass"
  ar15,"grep-no-rloop",the source tree is grepped for r#loop,the grep runs,zero matches are found
  ar16,"app-imports-agent-mod",an app/ file imports an Agent type from agent/,the import is inspected,"it imports agent:: (mod-level) symbols, not agent::facade"
  ar17,"store-in-memory",a test constructs Agent with InMemoryStore,a turn runs,the test passes without creating a real SessionManager
  ar18,"sink-records-events",a test constructs Agent with RecordingSink,compaction triggers lifecycle events,the sink contains the expected events
  ar19,"handler-in-runtime-protocol",the source tree is inspected for LifecycleHandler,its definition is located,it is defined under src/runtime_protocol/event.rs
  ar20,"auto-mapping",a protocol Event is converted back to domain,TryFrom is used,the conversion succeeds for all supported variants
  ar21,"builder-minimal-core","a conversation-only agent is desired",AgentBuilder is called with ports and a system prompt only,the agent runs turns with an empty tool set and no bash or export capability and never names a concrete infra type
  ar22,"turn-snapshot",a turn N is in flight,"set_tools is called mid-turn",turn N still uses the old tool set and turn N+1 uses the new set with no lock
  ar23,"before-chain-denies",a before hook denies the bash tool,the loop reaches the bash call,"execute is skipped and a tool-error result is recorded for the LLM"
  ar24,"add-hook-runtime",an agent is already built,add_hook pushes a second before callback,both callbacks run on the next tool call in registration order
  ar25,"react-agent-named",the source tree after the change,"rg '\\bAgentLoop\\b' src/ runs",zero matches remain and ReActAgent exists as the turn driver
  ar25,"shell-removed",the hollow Agent shell existed as pure delegation,the change is applied,no Agent struct with a single loop_ field remains; its methods live on ReActAgent
  ar26,"facade-gone","agent/facade.rs existed as the re-export hub",the source tree is inspected,"agent/facade.rs no longer exists and agent/mod.rs re-exports ReActAgent and Agent"
  ar27,"tool-call-then-continuation",a model round emits a FunctionCall then Done and the agent executes the tool,the loop processes the tool result and calls the model again,the model continuation round (a final text reply with no tool call) reaches the caller and the turn ends with that reply visible
  ar27,"plain-text-turn-unchanged",a model round emits only text and no tool call then Done,the loop terminates after that single round,"the turn ends after one round with no spurious continuation (the fix does not change plain-text behavior)"
  "ar-q1","drain-one","","one-at-a-time 模式下队列有两条消息并 drain",仅返回一条且队列仍剩一条
  "ar-q2","steer-inject","",流中 steer 一条消息后当前工具轮结束进入下一模型轮,steering 文本已注入历史并参与下一轮模型调用
  "ar-q3","emit-counts","",steer 入队一条,观察到 QueueUpdate 且 steer_count 为 1
  "ar-q4","abort-keep-fu","steer 与 follow-up 队列均非空",调用 abort,"steer 为空且 follow-up 仍保留原消息"
  "ar-ev1",degrade,消费者收到未映射事件变体,渲染或 bridge 处理,记录日志且不崩溃
